bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Following Authors Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control UserController
control UserService
control JwtService
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open Following Authors
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /following
activate Router

Router -> UserController: 3. get following
activate UserController
UserController -> UserService: 4. get following

activate UserService
UserService -> JwtService: 5. Verify token
activate JwtService
JwtService --> UserService: 6. Decoded
deactivate JwtService

UserService -> UserModel: 7. Find user
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 8. Find user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 9. Return user
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 10. User data
deactivate UserModel

opt User not found
    UserService --> UserController: 10.1. Throw error
    UserController --> Router: 10.2. HTTP error response
    Router --> UI: 10.3. Render error message
    UI --> User: 10.4. Show error
end

UserService --> UserController: 11. Return followings
deactivate UserService

UserController --> Router: 12. HTTP response
deactivate UserController
Router --> UI: 13. show list
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 14. Show list
deactivate UI
deactivate User